WEBVTT

00:26.440 --> 00:31.670
<b>I had this gut feeling, if you will. 
Something small that bothered me.</b>

00:31.950 --> 00:34.850
<b>Vichyssoise was one of our trump cards.</b>

00:35.180 --> 00:39.760
<b>Not many people, even from the Lou 
and the Zoa family, could stop her.</b>

00:40.150 --> 00:42.600
<b>I never thought she would fail.</b>

00:42.990 --> 00:46.350
<b>Should you be saying these things to me?</b>

00:46.350 --> 00:49.650
<b>Was it you who defeated her?</b>

00:49.650 --> 00:52.570
<b>Ex-eleventh seat of the Saint Disciples?</b>

00:52.960 --> 00:55.240
<b>I'm not going to answer that.</b>

00:55.670 --> 00:58.820
<b>This is why I had a bad feeling about this.</b>

00:59.060 --> 01:04.460
<b>That's why I sent another assassin, but 
it seems he hasn't arrived here yet.</b>

01:05.000 --> 01:06.000
<b>Assassin?</b>

01:06.000 --> 01:12.630
<b>But all is well. I must return 
to the royal palace soon anyway.</b>

01:12.630 --> 01:14.260
<b>Today is a big day—</b>

01:15.150 --> 01:21.120
<b>Last Crusade: Night of the Witch Hunt</b>

01:16.290 --> 01:19.850
<b>I was still talking.</b>

01:19.850 --> 01:21.120
<b>I don't care.</b>

01:30.760 --> 01:34.430
<b>It'd be dangerous to let you come any closer.</b>

01:36.480 --> 01:37.990
<b>The Great Eagre.</b>

01:43.990 --> 01:45.500
<b>My arm will be crushed!</b>

01:48.300 --> 01:50.920
<b>You evaded before I could capture you.</b>

01:50.920 --> 01:54.300
<b>You have a lot of experience 
for such a young man.</b>

01:54.730 --> 01:58.930
<b>A destroyer who has spent 
much time in the battlefield.</b>

02:10.790 --> 02:14.280
<b>If I move at the same time, I can 
jump in faster than the waves!</b>

02:14.620 --> 02:19.450
<b>It's rare to see an Imperial soldier 
who doesn't use a gun, but there's a—</b>

02:19.450 --> 02:21.120
<b>There's a barrier there, isn't there?</b>

02:23.950 --> 02:27.000
<b>Oh? What did you see?</b>

02:27.270 --> 02:28.250
<b>It was intuition.</b>

02:29.540 --> 02:32.160
<b>Saint Disciples are truly remarkable.</b>

02:32.160 --> 02:37.760
<b>An individual that can surpass a group 
in this day and age is a huge problem.</b>

02:39.440 --> 02:42.140
<b>I was waiting for someone like you.</b>

02:45.950 --> 02:50.840
<b>A wave is a wavelength of dynamic 
energy that has acquired a vector.</b>

02:50.840 --> 02:55.090
<b>It is the very physical quality 
that creates mass and acceleration.</b>

02:55.090 --> 02:57.570
<b>This you must already know.</b>

02:57.790 --> 02:58.490
<b>What?!</b>

02:58.490 --> 03:04.330
<b>You shouldn't lump all
wave astral mages together.</b>

03:08.920 --> 03:13.890
<b>He can do all this damage via 
simple contact with his fist?</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:17.330
<b>The Vicious Tyrant, Talisman.</b>

03:17.800 --> 03:22.320
<b>Although this moniker is far 
from my true intentions.</b>

03:23.270 --> 03:26.280
<b>Seems like it suits you.</b>

03:28.970 --> 03:31.980
<b>As a reward for safely 
escorting her to the palace,</b>

03:31.980 --> 03:34.620
<b>we get a sticker that can 
hide the boss's astral crest.</b>

03:35.070 --> 03:37.410
<b>This is becoming a deadly mission.</b>

03:37.410 --> 03:39.640
<b>D-Did you say something?!</b>

03:39.640 --> 03:40.900
<b>Nothing at all.</b>

03:40.900 --> 03:44.540
<b>Can't you do something using 
your astral power, Sisbell?</b>

03:44.910 --> 03:47.120
<b>Like blast everyone away?</b>

03:47.120 --> 03:50.580
<b>I wouldn't have hired a 
bodyguard if I could do that!</b>

03:50.950 --> 03:54.790
<b>But maybe I can buy us some time to escape.</b>

03:54.790 --> 03:59.120
<b>Stars, show me your past.</b>

03:59.650 --> 04:00.580
<b>What?!</b>

04:03.890 --> 04:07.340
<b>H-How was that? I was able to fool them.</b>

04:07.340 --> 04:10.680
<b>Yeah, it'll work the first time.</b>

04:10.930 --> 04:14.860
<b>Either way, we need to leave this palace,
or we'll be surrounded.</b>

04:15.310 --> 04:18.170
<b>Is there a room on the second 
floor that we could jump off from?</b>

04:19.260 --> 04:23.000
<b>Yes, maybe the corner guest 
room on the second floor.</b>

04:23.480 --> 04:25.170
<b>Isn't it cold here, Nene?</b>

04:25.170 --> 04:27.170
<b>It's cold, Captain.</b>

04:28.090 --> 04:29.030
<b>Huh?</b>

04:29.030 --> 04:33.790
<b>I found you, Imperial soldiers and Lady Sisbell.</b>

04:37.920 --> 04:44.300
<b>You escaped earlier, but you can't run 
for long with Lady Sisbell with you.</b>

04:44.540 --> 04:48.250
<b>Hey, grandma. You really 
are persistent, aren't you?</b>

04:48.740 --> 04:51.440
<b>Old people should be fast 
asleep this time of the hour.</b>

04:52.100 --> 04:55.420
<b>I would like to do just that.</b>

04:55.420 --> 04:59.030
<b>I have grown tired of chasing you.</b>

04:59.030 --> 05:01.820
<b>Hand over Lady Sisbell.</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:03.320
<b>Pass.</b>

05:04.030 --> 05:04.880
<b>Let's go!</b>

05:04.880 --> 05:05.740
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:04.880 --> 05:05.740
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:04.880 --> 05:05.740
<b>Yes!</b>

05:07.620 --> 05:09.830
<b>You little pipsqueaks!</b>

05:09.830 --> 05:11.800
<b>S-So many!</b>

05:12.150 --> 05:13.490
<b>Ignore it, boss!</b>

05:16.490 --> 05:21.960
<b>It feels like we're being hunted.
She shouldn't underestimate us too much.</b>

05:21.960 --> 05:27.880
<b>I converted the wave energy 
into physical acceleration.</b>

05:28.350 --> 05:32.700
<b>Any astral mage with this type 
of astral spirit can do this.</b>

05:34.080 --> 05:36.440
<b>Anyone? You're lying.</b>

05:36.780 --> 05:38.340
<b>It just requires training.</b>

05:47.240 --> 05:51.030
<b>Just as I thought. It's not the 
initial speed that makes him fast.</b>

05:51.300 --> 05:53.510
<b>His acceleration is through the roof.</b>

05:53.510 --> 05:56.080
<b>It's enhanced by the astral spirit of waves!</b>

06:02.110 --> 06:04.550
<b>Physical conversion of waves.</b>

06:04.860 --> 06:10.260
<b>It took me six years to create this technique.
And another eight to master it.</b>

06:10.260 --> 06:13.040
<b>Thirteen years to reach this palace.</b>

06:13.040 --> 06:17.980
<b>It took me nearly thirty years.
Skillful I am not.</b>

06:20.350 --> 06:24.400
<b>But you can't get to this 
level with a normal mentality.</b>

06:25.160 --> 06:31.030
<b>Can you understand what I'm trying 
to say, young Saint Disciple?</b>

06:31.030 --> 06:32.870
<b>I can't even evade it?!</b>

06:32.870 --> 06:38.870
<b>We are the same, walking the path of 
bloodshed, aiming to master ultimate power.</b>

06:42.060 --> 06:48.340
<b>Unfortunately, I'm older and well seasoned.
You can see the difference.</b>

06:48.340 --> 06:49.840
<b>Wait.</b>

06:49.840 --> 06:51.090
<b>What?</b>

06:54.300 --> 06:56.750
<b>I thought you took a direct hit.</b>

06:56.750 --> 06:58.770
<b>I did.</b>

06:58.770 --> 07:00.990
<b>Then how can you stand back up?</b>

07:01.420 --> 07:06.320
<b>If I didn't release the 
astral art, I was a goner.</b>

07:08.310 --> 07:12.390
<b>Beautiful! Just facing you gives me the shivers.</b>

07:12.390 --> 07:14.880
<b>Indeed, a terrifying opponent.</b>

07:14.880 --> 07:17.120
<b>That'd be my line, you con artist.</b>

07:17.560 --> 07:22.380
<b>How frustrating. I never 
thought I'd lose in speed.</b>

07:22.690 --> 07:25.630
<b>I've never felt so aggravated in my life.</b>

07:25.940 --> 07:27.950
<b>What a great stage.</b>

07:27.950 --> 07:33.880
<b>This palace is built on a hill, 
so the sunrise must be beautiful.</b>

07:33.880 --> 07:38.310
<b>A little ahead of yourself, 
aren't you? It's still midnight.</b>

07:38.680 --> 07:41.520
<b>That's why I must witness it.</b>

07:41.520 --> 07:46.600
<b>Tonight will be the last time 
the star, the Lou, will shine.</b>

07:46.600 --> 07:49.320
<b>The long night will finally come to an end.</b>

07:49.750 --> 07:52.150
<b>Are you saying the queen will fall?</b>

07:53.550 --> 07:58.700
<b>I cannot say such a thing, but you're 
smart to understand what I said that way.</b>

07:58.700 --> 08:00.450
<b>And then what?</b>

08:00.710 --> 08:06.130
<b>Isn't it obvious? When the starry night 
of the Lou ends, morning will come.</b>

08:06.130 --> 08:10.630
<b>It will be the start of the new world.</b>

08:11.430 --> 08:15.330
<b>I will eliminate you. Disappear from before me.</b>

08:16.260 --> 08:17.470
<b>Whoa, scary.</b>

08:19.900 --> 08:24.230
<b>I see, this is star-body astral 
spirit that interferes with matter.</b>

08:24.230 --> 08:26.020
<b>Isn't that right, missy?</b>

08:26.520 --> 08:29.780
<b>Do you think that's going to save your life?</b>

08:30.330 --> 08:34.120
<b>I heard second-gen astral spirits 
born from the depths of the planet</b>

08:34.120 --> 08:36.790
<b>usually give their owners 
a purple-colored crest.</b>

08:36.790 --> 08:38.120
<b>Lemme see it.</b>

08:38.390 --> 08:40.220
<b>Unfortunately, I am a lady.</b>

08:40.870 --> 08:43.250
<b>I have no intention of showing you my skin.</b>

08:44.320 --> 08:51.590
<b>Lady? That's some talk coming from a 
bloody witch, like you're a human being.</b>

08:52.920 --> 08:55.820
<b>I've always wanted a sample of a pureblood.</b>

08:55.820 --> 08:58.640
<b>I'll find out where your astral crest is,</b>

08:58.640 --> 09:02.800
<b>by ripping off that pretty dress of yours.</b>

09:05.360 --> 09:09.360
<b>Wonderful. It's as Uncle On told me.</b>

09:09.360 --> 09:12.370
<b>Imperial soldiers are savages.</b>

09:13.200 --> 09:14.860
<b>This is good.</b>

09:14.860 --> 09:19.430
<b>I can do terrible things 
without a care in the world.</b>

09:21.530 --> 09:23.790
<b>Disappear, Imperials.</b>

09:30.850 --> 09:34.510
<b>How about I give you a hard lesson 
with shards of glass, missy?!</b>

09:41.190 --> 09:44.410
<b>She used my astral spirit's automatic 
defense to her advantage...</b>

09:44.890 --> 09:50.600
<b>How lame. Your astral spirit looks strong, 
but you're a sheltered little girl.</b>

09:50.600 --> 09:54.240
<b>Not knowing how to play mind games 
makes you less than a witch.</b>

09:54.240 --> 09:56.070
<b>You're just a doll.</b>

09:56.070 --> 09:57.030
<b>Kill her.</b>

09:58.520 --> 10:01.780
<b>Do not underestimate the 
descendant of the Founder.</b>

10:01.780 --> 10:02.770
<b>Impossible!</b>

10:02.770 --> 10:05.430
<b>Did she block all the bullets?!</b>

10:05.430 --> 10:09.880
<b>Even the Lous and Hydras don't have 
Zoa's control of astral power.</b>

10:09.880 --> 10:12.080
<b>Oh, that was a slip.</b>

10:12.080 --> 10:16.270
<b>Uncle On had told me not 
to tell anyone about this.</b>

10:18.530 --> 10:21.780
<b>"Ruined King Hurricane," activate.</b>

10:23.060 --> 10:25.560
<b>Thorns! Rip that woman to—</b>

10:24.800 --> 10:30.180
<b>Didn't I tell you? I'm gonna show you why 
they call me the "Incessant Tempest."</b>

10:30.770 --> 10:33.730
<b>Looks like this is goodbye, 
my cute little witch.</b>

10:40.900 --> 10:42.920
<b>First, let me express my gratitude.</b>

10:42.920 --> 10:48.110
<b>The fate of this planet 
brought us a wonderful guest.</b>

10:50.930 --> 10:51.780
<b>What?</b>

10:52.210 --> 10:54.090
<b>Oops, that was close.</b>

10:54.090 --> 10:56.820
<b>So that's how this is going to play out?</b>

10:57.240 --> 11:00.550
<b>Do you remember an Imperial 
soldier called Mismis?</b>

11:00.550 --> 11:01.980
<b>Mismis?</b>

11:01.980 --> 11:06.830
<b>She's a captain from the Imperial 
army. You met her at Mudor Canyon.</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:09.170
<b>The one you kicked into the Vortex.</b>

11:09.770 --> 11:15.410
<b>We joined at the same time, 
so I've heard a lot about you.</b>

11:15.410 --> 11:20.280
<b>Ah, I remember now. That little lady.</b>

11:20.620 --> 11:24.910
<b>I see. If that's how you're connected,
everything makes sense.</b>

11:25.170 --> 11:30.050
<b>What a surprise, though.
Your friend is at a captain's level,</b>

11:30.050 --> 11:32.690
<b>but you were promoted to Saint Disciple?</b>

11:32.690 --> 11:34.630
<b>Well, yes.</b>

11:34.630 --> 11:39.930
<b>I heard that the Imperial army 
is very competitive when it comes to rank.</b>

11:40.740 --> 11:43.080
<b>Many people must be jealous of you.</b>

11:43.470 --> 11:48.410
<b>I'm used to it. After all, this is 
my fourth time being 22 years old.</b>

11:48.810 --> 11:55.980
<b>Is that so? Rather than a talented 
young lady, you're an old veteran, then.</b>

11:56.510 --> 11:59.150
<b>No, no! I'm a lady!</b>

11:59.150 --> 12:03.350
<b>It's my policy to start over 
before reaching my thirties.</b>

12:03.350 --> 12:06.590
<b>Right now, I'm a lady in full bloom.</b>

12:08.990 --> 12:18.000
<b>Now, then, the Eight Great Apostles 
gave me a quota of purebreds to capture.</b>

12:18.000 --> 12:20.510
<b>An Imperial soldier that uses astral art?</b>

12:22.200 --> 12:26.640
<b>Allow me to measure the depth of your sin.</b>

12:29.840 --> 12:32.500
<b>Is this an embodiment of astral energy?</b>

12:32.500 --> 12:38.000
<b>This is an avatar. You have committed a sin.</b>

12:38.000 --> 12:41.320
<b>That sin has become your punishment.</b>

12:41.320 --> 12:45.920
<b>Carelessly attacking me has become your undoing.</b>

12:47.120 --> 12:52.650
<b>Can you escape from your own punishment?</b>

12:52.650 --> 12:53.830
<b>Punishment?</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:57.170
<b>Unfortunately, I don't plan 
on asking for forgiveness.</b>

12:58.640 --> 12:59.840
<b>Annoying.</b>

13:03.280 --> 13:05.090
<b>Pesky thing.</b>

13:09.260 --> 13:14.990
<b>It's useless. This avatar is 
immune to all physical attacks.</b>

13:15.740 --> 13:18.050
<b>A counterattack-type astral spirit?</b>

13:18.590 --> 13:22.040
<b>Astral energy grows in response to the enemy.</b>

13:23.010 --> 13:27.990
<b>When it grows to a certain point,
it takes on the form of a beast and attacks.</b>

13:28.420 --> 13:34.920
<b>The condition for its growth is if 
I damage you... and something else.</b>

13:35.390 --> 13:40.710
<b>There are multiple conditions. 
Something that you refer to as "sin."</b>

13:41.950 --> 13:45.610
<b>I'll give you credit. You're pretty close.</b>

13:45.610 --> 13:48.110
<b>I'll tell you one thing.</b>

13:48.110 --> 13:52.470
<b>This avatar will grow indefinitely.</b>

13:52.470 --> 13:54.790
<b>Ugly astral spirit...</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:58.850
<b>Its ability to go through physical 
objects will be the death of you.</b>

14:09.300 --> 14:13.500
<b>Die with your astral spirit, demon.</b>

14:18.250 --> 14:21.540
<b>Just as I thought. They're hiding 
in the dark to attack us!</b>

14:25.590 --> 14:27.070
<b>How could this be?</b>

14:27.070 --> 14:31.060
<b>Lady Alice! We don't know where 
the Imperial soldiers are hiding.</b>

14:31.560 --> 14:32.470
<b>Please be careful.</b>

14:33.330 --> 14:35.560
<b>You're safe, Lady Alice!</b>

14:35.920 --> 14:38.810
<b>Tell me what you know of the situation.</b>

14:38.810 --> 14:42.670
<b>Of course! The defense of the 
queen's palace is our top priority.</b>

14:43.150 --> 14:47.250
<b>Lady Alice, please hurry! 
Please go to the queen!</b>

14:47.760 --> 14:49.620
<b>We'll deal with the fires.</b>

14:50.480 --> 14:52.410
<b>No, stop!</b>

14:56.700 --> 14:59.910
<b>You two! Rin, where are the medics?!</b>

14:59.910 --> 15:01.020
<b>Hurry!</b>

15:01.020 --> 15:01.680
<b>Right!</b>

15:07.780 --> 15:10.830
<b>Rin, take everyone to the shelter.</b>

15:11.160 --> 15:13.300
<b>There should be doctors there.</b>

15:13.720 --> 15:15.600
<b>I'll wait here.</b>

15:16.210 --> 15:18.630
<b>But Lady Alice...</b>

15:19.600 --> 15:21.120
<b>I'm calm.</b>

15:21.850 --> 15:23.530
<b>I think I'm calm.</b>

15:24.590 --> 15:31.200
<b>The castle should be well defended. 
This area has been hit the worst.</b>

15:35.240 --> 15:40.000
<b>I'll extinguish the fires,
so come back in 15 minutes!</b>

15:40.260 --> 15:42.620
<b>As you wish!</b>

15:47.670 --> 15:49.740
<b>If I'm even a minute late,</b>

15:49.740 --> 15:52.910
<b>please head for the queen's 
palace by yourself, Lady Alice!</b>

15:54.440 --> 15:58.260
<b>It's okay. I didn't make the wrong decision.</b>

15:59.270 --> 16:04.260
<b>Even a Saint Disciple can't get to the 
queen's palace in such short time.</b>

16:04.980 --> 16:07.270
<b>Everyone, listen up!</b>

16:07.270 --> 16:08.910
<b>I'm going to extinguish the fire all at once!</b>

16:08.910 --> 16:12.560
<b>It's dangerous, so get behind me immediately!</b>

16:15.010 --> 16:19.580
<b>First, they hit the fuel tanks 
in the quarantine warehouse.</b>

16:19.580 --> 16:22.110
<b>If a large fire was started using that fuel,</b>

16:22.110 --> 16:26.350
<b>even the best of the palace's elite would 
have difficulty putting it out.</b>

16:27.060 --> 16:30.570
<b>I'm glad the assault went successfully.</b>

16:33.030 --> 16:36.090
<b>Lady Elletear! Lady Elletear!</b>

16:36.090 --> 16:41.700
<b>The only thing left is Lord Talisman's part.
Hopefully he captured Sisbell.</b>

16:36.350 --> 16:39.700
<b>We're being ambushed by the 
Imperial army! Please evacuate!</b>

16:39.700 --> 16:43.230
<b>Lady Elletear, you must hurry!</b>

16:43.540 --> 16:44.600
<b>Minister...</b>

16:44.600 --> 16:47.550
<b>Y-Yes, Lady Elletear? Come quickly!</b>

16:47.550 --> 16:49.640
<b>You needn't worry.</b>

16:49.640 --> 16:50.760
<b>Huh?</b>

16:51.270 --> 16:54.170
<b>You evacuate and head to the shelter first.</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:58.640
<b>The enemy must be targeting the 
queen's palace, so stay away.</b>

16:59.230 --> 17:02.470
<b>There's no need for 
non-combatants to be injured.</b>

17:02.470 --> 17:04.830
<b>B-But what will you do, Lady Elletear?</b>

17:04.830 --> 17:07.760
<b>I'll go there later.</b>

17:11.000 --> 17:15.190
<b>Please, please be safe, Lady Elletear.</b>

17:18.030 --> 17:22.890
<b>Now... I wonder if the Saint Disciples 
were able to reach the queen's palace?</b>

17:22.890 --> 17:25.910
<b>It isn't my preference for 
many people to get hurt.</b>

17:25.910 --> 17:29.740
<b>I'd be happy if they can get 
rid of the queen quickly.</b>

17:30.230 --> 17:33.850
<b>I should also get ready.</b>

17:35.130 --> 17:38.460
<b>Alice, Sisbell, Mother...</b>

17:38.930 --> 17:42.380
<b>You will probably never understand me.</b>

17:43.260 --> 17:47.960
<b>This is my own way to cleanse the Sovereignty.</b>

17:47.960 --> 17:52.170
<b>Queen Nebulis, I don't plan on taking my time.</b>

17:52.560 --> 17:53.840
<b>Therefore,</b>

17:54.800 --> 17:56.550
<b>die here and now.</b>

17:56.550 --> 17:57.690
<b>Fall into the pits of hell!</b>

18:04.250 --> 18:09.700
<b>The Serene Wind, Milla. Contrary to 
that name, your astral art is aggressive.</b>

18:10.290 --> 18:13.530
<b>That was a decade ago.</b>

18:14.370 --> 18:16.690
<b>Millavair Lou Nebulis VIII.</b>

18:16.970 --> 18:21.530
<b>An astral mage with an astral 
spirit of air, sub-type of wind.</b>

18:22.080 --> 18:27.000
<b>You control air itself on a much 
larger scale, rather than just wind.</b>

18:27.550 --> 18:29.950
<b>You were 11 years old when 
you entered the battlefield.</b>

18:29.950 --> 18:34.310
<b>In the ten years since then, you fought 
more battles than any other pureblood,</b>

18:34.310 --> 18:37.760
<b>taking 3% of the Empire's territory.</b>

18:38.330 --> 18:39.780
<b>Despite being a witch,</b>

18:39.780 --> 18:43.930
<b>you were the Sovereignty's most 
skilled martial artist and assassin.</b>

18:43.930 --> 18:47.890
<b>You were considered the most powerful 
candidate for queen in history.</b>

18:48.130 --> 18:50.810
<b>However, you've gotten weaker.</b>

18:51.210 --> 18:56.530
<b>You speak of your imagination 
as if it's something you've seen yourself.</b>

18:56.530 --> 19:00.490
<b>It was actually seen
by the people in this palace.</b>

19:00.490 --> 19:02.020
<b>I see.</b>

19:02.450 --> 19:04.360
<b>The guards haven't arrived yet?</b>

19:04.360 --> 19:09.080
<b>With such a loud rumble,
guards nearby would have noticed.</b>

19:09.080 --> 19:15.800
<b>One must make choices. It doesn't 
matter if my power alone weakens.</b>

19:15.800 --> 19:20.010
<b>Have the other Saint Disciples infiltrated 
the palace and begun fighting?</b>

19:20.010 --> 19:25.120
<b>If I can protect the nation as queen,
that is the right choice.</b>

19:25.530 --> 19:28.320
<b>She should already be here.</b>

19:28.720 --> 19:30.850
<b>Is your plan to wait for the Ice Calamity Witch?</b>

19:35.270 --> 19:36.980
<b>Bomb Cyclone!</b>

19:38.400 --> 19:40.110
<b>So there were conspirators.</b>

19:40.370 --> 19:45.610
<b>It's an information war. I don't intend 
to kill you by attacking head on.</b>

19:45.610 --> 19:47.330
<b>It must be Elletear.</b>

19:49.570 --> 19:50.470
<b>Prepare to die.</b>

19:50.470 --> 19:53.210
<b>I think you're underestimating me.</b>

19:54.900 --> 20:00.650
<b>I have no choice, since neither the 
guards nor Alice will be coming soon.</b>

20:00.650 --> 20:06.470
<b>I don't like the idea of destroying 
the Queen's Hall myself,</b>

20:07.250 --> 20:11.430
<b>but the show's over.</b>

20:12.450 --> 20:16.340
<b>This is a very, very ancient nation.</b>

20:16.900 --> 20:22.110
<b>The Lous and current queen hold balance 
in the war against the Empire.</b>

20:22.450 --> 20:26.170
<b>The Zoas continue to scream for 
revenge against the Empire.</b>

20:26.480 --> 20:30.750
<b>The Hydras have grown tired 
of this nation's situation.</b>

20:31.530 --> 20:34.640
<b>What do you think, Imperial soldier?</b>

20:35.780 --> 20:38.770
<b>Is this really just a wave astral art?!</b>

20:39.250 --> 20:42.130
<b>Truly, you've got great eyes.</b>

20:43.850 --> 20:48.720
<b>You even saw this coming. Was it 
your hearing? No, did you feel it?</b>

20:49.380 --> 20:50.970
<b>Both!</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:03.230
<b>How many large waves are 
compressed on his fist?!</b>

21:03.570 --> 21:08.910
<b>Wonderful. It's as if you have 
Sonar from head to toe.</b>

21:10.030 --> 21:15.080
<b>Why do you risk your life 
protecting Lady Sisbell?</b>

21:15.520 --> 21:18.840
<b>How big a reward did she promise you?</b>

21:18.840 --> 21:21.780
<b>You attacked us first.</b>

21:21.780 --> 21:24.220
<b>Why wouldn't I chase away a violent mob?</b>

21:24.220 --> 21:26.630
<b>It may be too late, but you have it wrong.</b>

21:27.240 --> 21:30.220
<b>This is a palace owned by 
the Sovereignty's royalty.</b>

21:30.220 --> 21:34.980
<b>Ordinarily, no one would imagine
Imperial soldiers being here.</b>

21:34.980 --> 21:38.440
<b>Bull. Elletear must have told you.</b>

21:39.800 --> 21:42.580
<b>Why did Elletear betray her own mother?</b>

21:43.180 --> 21:45.430
<b>What do you think of her beauty?</b>

21:45.840 --> 21:46.990
<b>What?</b>

21:47.320 --> 21:53.260
<b>If there is such a thing as witchcraft, 
that would be what Elletear's beauty is.</b>

21:53.700 --> 21:58.000
<b>In front of her beauty, even the goddess 
herself would want to serve her.</b>

21:58.000 --> 22:01.710
<b>Her beauty must be a gift from the gods.</b>

22:02.070 --> 22:03.090
<b>However,</b>

22:05.260 --> 22:08.050
<b>she was not loved by the planet.</b>

22:08.870 --> 22:11.240
<b>You misunderstand one thing.</b>

22:11.240 --> 22:14.590
<b>The goals of Hydra and 
Elletear are not the same.</b>

22:15.180 --> 22:20.480
<b>We simply share the same first 
step in realizing our ideals.</b>

22:20.880 --> 22:23.260
<b>And that's to overthrow the queen?</b>

22:23.260 --> 22:28.860
<b>If we can take out the current queen, 
the Sovereignty will temporarily weaken.</b>

22:28.860 --> 22:32.700
<b>It would give us an advantage in future battles.</b>

22:32.920 --> 22:36.080
<b>Is that what you said to the Empire?</b>

22:36.080 --> 22:38.830
<b>I'll leave that to your imagination.</b>

22:39.110 --> 22:41.630
<b>Let me answer one thing for you!</b>

22:43.710 --> 22:47.720
<b>This isn't the kind of battle
I want to have with the Sovereignty.</b>

22:47.720 --> 22:49.770
<b>What do you mean?</b>

22:49.770 --> 22:53.050
<b>Nothing will change if you do 
things the way you're doing!</b>

22:53.050 --> 22:58.850
<b>Both nations will continue to hurt, 
their relationship will worsen, and that's it.</b>

22:58.850 --> 23:03.560
<b>That isn't it. That isn't 
the "end" I'm aiming for!</b>

23:04.270 --> 23:09.900
<b>I don't want the Empire to fall,
nor the Sovereignty!</b>

23:11.840 --> 23:16.660
<b>Such a romantic! You dream 
of a very sweet fantasy.</b>

23:16.660 --> 23:19.750
<b>You're full of romanticism,
unfit for a destroyer such as yourself.</b>

23:19.750 --> 23:25.440
<b>However, the other Saint Disciples 
and the royals other than the Lous</b>

23:25.440 --> 23:28.710
<b>were longing for this day to come, I believe.</b>

23:28.710 --> 23:30.510
<b>What does that mean?</b>

23:31.040 --> 23:39.600
<b>They wanted to compare. The decade-long 
question of who is superior?</b>

23:41.190 --> 23:43.940
<b>The Saint Disciples of the Empire,</b>

23:43.940 --> 23:47.360
<b>or the purebreds,
the descendants of the Founder?</b>

23:47.630 --> 23:51.840
<b>They want to clarify,
once and for all, which is better.</b>

23:53.710 --> 23:54.600
<b>That's what</b>

23:56.820 --> 23:59.130
<b>this night is about.</b>
